    },
    {
      "id": "yuan-256",
      "category": "元曲",
      "title": "沉醉东风",
      "subtitle": "恰离了绿水青山那搭",
      "author": "卢挚",
      "dynasty": "元",
      "content": "恰离了绿水青山那搭，早来到竹篱茅舍人家。野花路畔开，村酒槽头榨，直吃的欠欠答答。\n醉了山童不劝咱，白发上黄花乱插。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "155c3d06e3f9c4382d2bdafca5d2e08e9ce81829871f5e50957ceb3eac42da41",
      "estimatedOutput": 714,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/yuan-256--155c3d06e3f9c4382d2bdafca5d2e08e9ce81829871f5e50957ceb3eac42da41.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "yuan-257",
      "category": "元曲",
      "title": "沉醉东风·重九",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "卢挚",
      "dynasty": "元",
      "content": "题红叶清流御沟，赏黄花人醉歌楼。天长雁影稀，月落山容瘦，冷清清暮秋时候。\n衰柳寒蝉一片愁，谁肯教白衣送酒？",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "566f603fea98778cf83c4d2071ace8c9371e5689dde79890715e52d0222c8c90",
      "estimatedOutput": 706,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/yuan-257--566f603fea98778cf83c4d2071ace8c9371e5689dde79890715e52d0222c8c90.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "yuan-258",
      "category": "元曲",
      "title": "沉醉东风·七夕",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "卢挚",
      "dynasty": "元",
      "content": "银烛冷秋光画屏，碧天晴夜静闲亭。\n蛛丝度绣针，龙麝焚金鼎。\n庆人间七夕佳令。卧看牵牛织女星，月转过梧桐树影。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "11cc9fd4e8f282c97bd02948e5332ce06918a7bc8785ecef47566b1068c6c2c1",
      "estimatedOutput": 708,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/yuan-258--11cc9fd4e8f282c97bd02948e5332ce06918a7bc8785ecef47566b1068c6c2c1.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "yuan-259",
      "category": "元曲",
      "title": "蟾宫曲·扬州汪右丞席上即事",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "卢挚",
      "dynasty": "元",
      "content": "江城歌吹风流，雨过平山，月满西楼。几特年华，三生醉梦，六月凉秋。\n按锦瑟佳人劝酒，卷朱帘齐按《凉州》。客去还留，云树萧萧，河汉悠悠。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "517b21ef0e10c89a0af89e6ca6b1468b41cd62f7b6fd82c62d72b748f2003307",
      "estimatedOutput": 732,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/yuan-259--517b21ef0e10c89a0af89e6ca6b1468b41cd62f7b6fd82c62d72b748f2003307.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "yuan-260",
      "category": "元曲",
      "title": "双调·殿前欢",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "卢挚",
      "dynasty": "元",
      "content": "酒杯浓，一葫芦春色醉山翁，一葫芦酒压花梢重。随我奚童，葫芦乾兴不穷。谁与共？一带青山送。乘风列子，列子乘风。\n酒新篘，一葫芦春醉海棠洲，一葫芦未饮香先透。俯仰糟丘，傲人间万户侯。重酣后，梦景皆虚谬。庄周化蝶，蝶化庄周。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "8427f2cc90e2ea2daa26f63ecf9c943c9c8dd9a0ebcc6b0aaf28d53e489006d2",
      "estimatedOutput": 818,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/yuan-260--8427f2cc90e2ea2daa26f63ecf9c943c9c8dd9a0ebcc6b0aaf28d53e489006d2.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "yuan-261",
      "category": "元曲",
      "title": "黄钟·节节高·题洞庭鹿",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "卢挚",
      "dynasty": "元",
      "content": "雨睛云散，满江明月。风微浪息，扁舟一叶。半夜心。三生梦，万里别，闷倚篷窗睡些。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "6ea3550691474166ad63e09671b3e29845ef7f425aace4174cfcd432a99fb3b0",
      "estimatedOutput": 678,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/yuan-261--6ea3550691474166ad63e09671b3e29845ef7f425aace4174cfcd432a99fb3b0.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "yuan-262",
      "category": "元曲",
      "title": "双调·沉醉东风·春情",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "卢挚",
      "dynasty": "元",
      "content": "残花酿蜂儿蜜脾，细雨和燕子香泥。白雪柳絮飞，红雨桃花坠，杜鹃声里又春归。纵有新诗赠别离，医不可相思病体。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "8c807b587ef2dd1ced9dfa646959b5016bc2f67089d263ce12b8af4f2360b17a",
      "estimatedOutput": 704,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/yuan-262--8c807b587ef2dd1ced9dfa646959b5016bc2f67089d263ce12b8af4f2360b17a.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "yuan-263",
      "category": "元曲",
      "title": "双调·蟾宫曲·丽华",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "卢挚",
      "dynasty": "元",
      "content": "叹南朝六代倾危，结绮临春，今已成灰。惟有台城，挂残阳水绕山围。胭脂井金陵草萋，后庭空玉树花飞。燕舞莺啼，王谢堂前，待得春归。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "73796120c0f6e2744ebe52bcdd0421cc6c8e31b5337a7eb6134976e569e00d25",
      "estimatedOutput": 724,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/yuan-263--73796120c0f6e2744ebe52bcdd0421cc6c8e31b5337a7eb6134976e569e00d25.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "yuan-264",
      "category": "元曲",
      "title": "双调·殿前欢",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "卢挚",
      "dynasty": "元",
      "content": "沙三伴哥来嗏！两腿青泥，只为捞虾。太公庄上，杨柳阴中，磕破西瓜。小二哥昔涎剌塔，碌轴上渰着个琵琶。看荞麦开花，绿豆生芽。无是无非，快活煞庄家。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "00e4a7a405072e403d60a95f9746527825ea644e7cecea63d52635dbaf27b6cd",
      "estimatedOutput": 742,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/yuan-264--00e4a7a405072e403d60a95f9746527825ea644e7cecea63d52635dbaf27b6cd.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "yuan-265",
      "category": "元曲",
      "title": "双调·落梅风",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "周文质",
      "dynasty": "元",
      "content": "新秋夜，微醉时，月明中倚栏独自。吟成几联断肠诗，说不尽满怀心事。\n鸾凤配，莺燕约，感萧娘肯怜才貌。除琴剑又别无珍共宝，则一片至诚心要也不要？",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "9446db9cb1ce2dbabe1e9901ef3c9d37243ab9834d54473e2a681f9ee5dd22e3",
